  "releaseNotes": "Bug Fixes\n- Fixed stability issues when OCRing large volumes of PDFs in parallel and added controls to limit OCR memory usage\n- Fixed loading of large TIFF files and improved error messages for unsupported TIFF images\nUpdates\n- Updated internal dependencies",
